===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|мѣ́сяцъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|мѣсѧць}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*měsęcь}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*mḗh₁n̥s}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ме́сяц}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-месяц.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|ме́сяц|adj=ме́сячный|dim=месяцо́к|pej=месячи́шко}}

# {{topics|ru|Time}} [[month]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в]] '''ме́сяц'''|per '''month'''}}
# {{lb|ru|archaic}} {{topics|ru|Light sources|Moons}} [[moon]] {{gl|the Earth's only permanent natural satellite, including a full moon}}
#: {{syn|ru|луна́}}
# [[moon]] {{q|in '''modern Russian''' usually referring to a [[crescent]] or a [[gibbous]] moon, but not a full moon}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[молодо́й]] '''ме́сяц'''|new '''moon'''}}

====Usage notes====
Stress shift to the ending is standard in {{m|ru|[[по]] '''месяца́м'''}} and {{m|ru|'''[[месяца́ми]]'''|t=for months}}, but this has led to occasional non-standard use of the full stress pattern with final stress in all plural forms and an -а ending in the nominative/accusative plural (see {{m|ru|го́род}}).

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|ме́сяц}}

